*                                                                               
FILE W27194D3 VB (75 0) PRINTER                                                 
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
  UT-VECKA             W  4  N                                                  
  UT-FILLER1           W  1  A                                                  
  UT-IDDISTR           W  4  N      MASK 'ZZZ9'                                 
  UT-FILLER2           W  1  A                                                  
