NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*                    WORKING STORAGE                             *              
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*                                                                               
  JA                        W   1  A   VALUE 'J'                                
  NEJ                       W   1  A   VALUE 'N'                                
  W-TAB                     W   1  A   VALUE X'05'                              
*                                                                               
*    -- CHECKED BY WY2000                                                       
