NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*                    JOB SECTION                                 *              
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*                                                                               
  JOB INPUT W27194D1 +                                                          
      NAME   STEG01                                                             
                                                                                
     UT-VECKA            = IN-VECKA                                             
     UT-IDDISTR          = IN-IDDISTR                                           
     UT-VLORDBTO-KOLLI   = IN-VLORDBTO-KOLLI                                    
