*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*                    REPORT SECTION                              *              
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*                                                                               
    REPORT RAPPORT01 PRINTER W27194D3                            +              
                     LINESIZE      70                            +              
                     PAGESIZE      60                            +              
                     NODATE                                      +              
                     NOHEADING                                   +              
                     NOADJUST                                    +              
                     NOSPREAD                                    +              
                     SPACE          3                                           
