    SEQUENCE UT-IDDISTR                                                         
    CONTROL                                                      +              
              FINAL          NOPRINT                                            
*                                                                               
    TITLE 1  '¤DAPW27194-001'                                                   
    TITLE 2  '¤DAPW27194'                                                       
